[{"title":"寄答王子新","author":"王廷陈","text":"河上逢君英妙年，吾家逸少早知贤。\n别来落落贪毫素，客过时时问草玄。\n岐路飘零交有自，殊方迟暮见无缘。\n开缄忽忆艰难日，一度长吟一惘然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21928,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿孙毅庵京兆八十公常为给舍","author":"王廷陈","text":"丈人七十弃簪裾，十载高踪海上庐。\n谢客风流诗卷里，镜湖烟水钓竿馀。\n中朝谏草焚应尽，南国甘棠爱不疏。\n莫谓石床眠已稳，直愁门外候安车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21929,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉赠桐冈郭侯考绩北上","author":"王廷陈","text":"依依山郭枕江流，藉藉专城颂细侯。\n高士独过频下榻，自公多暇一登楼。\n深恩久结黄人爱，苦节真分汉主忧。\n跃马忽看朝帝去，攀辕何计望君留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21930,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜奉简浚川先生舟次兼酬留赠之作","author":"王廷陈","text":"独舸高秋动旅寒，晚怜旌节驻江干。\n城迎月浪层层白，岸匝霜枫袅袅丹。\n夜玉光留居士里，沙鸥眠傍使君滩。\n不缘病卧妨尊酒，秉烛常陪挹渚兰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21931,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病后答友人","author":"王廷陈","text":"一亩居连郢客乡，三年愁隔汉川长。\n青山各有幽栖志，白雪遥传寡和章。\n自傍云霞开药圃，不将尘土洒荷裳。\n洞庭雪后烟波阔，花底乘舟到草堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21932,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题","author":"王廷陈","text":"病起江湖复早春，黑头何愧此閒身。\n行歌白石嗟齐相，笑咏沧浪忆楚臣。\n拄杖云中穿薜荔，鸣琴烟里坐松筠。\n溪边不必秋风起，自有鲂鱼色胜银。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21933,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张子","author":"王廷陈","text":"爱尔清狂甚，兼之才调殊。\n不须愁贝锦，已是握灵珠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21934,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"放鱼","author":"王廷陈","text":"欲作银丝鲙，翻怜锦鬣殊。\n沧波放尔去，何用报明珠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21935,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜叹五首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"度牖含风色，悬楼转雪辉。\n天边照羁羽，不比鹊南飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21936,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜叹五首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"明月岁如此，青枫再改颜。\n故山有丛桂，怅望几时攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21937,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜叹五首 其三","author":"王廷陈","text":"莫谓高栖稳，高栖翻累躯。\n清光逼禁树，树树有惊乌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21938,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜叹五首 其四","author":"王廷陈","text":"玉关同一照，玉镜几回圆。\n莫作征人妇，高楼长自眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21939,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜叹五首 其五","author":"王廷陈","text":"万古关山曲，仍传笛里风。\n中宵报烽火，残魄倚张弓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21940,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂述八首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"冬林覆草閤，兀坐雪云停。\n避世栖金马，无人知岁星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21941,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂述八首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"日高不盥栉，搔首行且歌。\n飞来避缴鸟，戢翼盼庭柯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21942,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂述八首 其三","author":"王廷陈","text":"予本潇湘客，不作潇湘游。\n援琴奏流水，寂寂帝妃愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21943,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂述八首 其四","author":"王廷陈","text":"南人慕炎方，岁宴寡所欢。\n虽有千金裘，不禦北风寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21944,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂述八首 其五","author":"王廷陈","text":"出门乘款段，中道值权珰。\n黠校四五徒，前驱何尔强。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21945,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂述八首 其六","author":"王廷陈","text":"清晨谒承明，百官仍依依。\n回立讯中使，君王何时归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21946,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂述八首 其七","author":"王廷陈","text":"对酒愿一醉，醉后忘悲辛。\n怜予亦楚产，不似独醒人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21947,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂述八首 其八","author":"王廷陈","text":"哀歌抚剑匣，雄剑且莫鸣。\n风云倘不负，仗尔事横行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21948,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪边草堂杂咏六首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"鼓楫遵花屿，扪萝憩草堂。\n门添新竹槛，壁挂旧荷裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21949,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪边草堂杂咏六首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"芋叶深藏径，荷花浅覆艭。\n阶除驯白鸟，村巷接清江。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21950,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪边草堂杂咏六首 其三","author":"王廷陈","text":"触荇凫雏没，穿篱竹笋苞。\n渠壅更凿石，屋破自诛茅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21951,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪边草堂杂咏六首 其四","author":"王廷陈","text":"日出扉初启，风生席屡移。\n当窗交碧树，隔户响黄鹂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21952,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪边草堂杂咏六首 其五","author":"王廷陈","text":"晨径露萦草，午园风振条。\n鸬鹚窥浦溆，翡翠集兰苕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21953,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪边草堂杂咏六首 其六","author":"王廷陈","text":"孤石堪垂钓，清流可濯缨。\n沿回终日兴，偃卧百年情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21954,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕雨四首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"元夕人间重，冥冥暮雨闻。\n眼前歌妓散，疑是楚行云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21955,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕雨四首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"结伴非无约，张灯亦有情。\n春光妒罗绮，不放此宵明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21956,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕雨四首 其三","author":"王廷陈","text":"歌吹催春事，风光预可赊。\n请看飞雨度，点点著银花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21957,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕雨四首 其四","author":"王廷陈","text":"游女江皋上，纤裳雾雨垂。\n那能惜罗袜，缓步踏春泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21958,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京元夕曲 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"大道朱楼锦绣围，歌钟万户竞春辉。\n楼前火树嶙峋照，化作红云片片飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21959,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京元夕曲 其三","author":"王廷陈","text":"万柳千花巧自妆，春风吹散绮罗香。\n谁教月色模糊甚，恼杀幽并游冶郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21960,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人游越中五首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"寺閤岩楼望不稀，越王城畔早春归。\n寻溪放舸烟花豁，立马听莺醉落晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21961,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人游越中五首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"雁荡汀洲天汉流，奔雷喷雪下龙湫。\n北风晴雾濛濛合，倚石扪萝迥自愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21962,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人游越中五首 其三","author":"王廷陈","text":"华顶晴登挹彩霞，云君仙子列如麻。\n琅玕芝草幽难掇，来往时瞻白鹿车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21963,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人游越中五首 其四","author":"王廷陈","text":"合沓岩峦生紫烟，赤城遥见石梁悬。\n攀松帖岸窥难下，鹤驾鸾骖度羽仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21964,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人游越中五首 其五","author":"王廷陈","text":"挂席东南万里回，海潮八月拍天来。\n巨鳌一涌三山动，五色楼台中自开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21965,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李中丞三首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"晴旭烟郊列骑回，中丞春旆拂梁台。\n金符玉节层霄下，甸雪河冰万里开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21966,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李中丞三首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"九曲风涛迥自惊，黄河天畔绕孤城。\n中宵笳鼓扬帆渡，万古鲸鲵避楫行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21967,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李中丞三首 其三","author":"王廷陈","text":"夜月辕门铁骑寒，龙旗千队指楼兰。\n丈夫莫负封侯骨，破敌归来望玉鞍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21968,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题三首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"莫谓娥眉不受怜，宫中元自妒婵娟。\n亦知白璧终难掷，何事青蝇但屡煎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21969,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题三首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"洞庭南望结愁云，杜若江皋秖自芬。\n贾谊上书忧汉室，屈平投赋吊湘君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21970,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题三首 其三","author":"王廷陈","text":"宝匣谁当垂拂拭，龙文夜夜斗牛间。\n可怜日月双埋剑，实想云霄一赐环。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21971,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠董氏兄弟","author":"王廷陈","text":"我爱谢家双玉树，双凌云日散光辉。\n伫看北极随鹓鹭，倘念南山老蕨薇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21972,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻恩诏有感四首 其一","author":"王廷陈","text":"天书十道出枫宸，紫极回瞻御气新。\n浩荡遥缄三殿雨，沾濡长作万方春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21973,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻恩诏有感四首 其二","author":"王廷陈","text":"姬年八百未为多，虞日讴歌许更过。\n已掷风雷开蛰户，更添江海接恩波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21974,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻恩诏有感四首 其三","author":"王廷陈","text":"天地重开日月移，幽人感激中兴时。\n湘累莫漫题芳杜，汉皓何须咏紫芝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21975,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻恩诏有感四首 其四","author":"王廷陈","text":"春风翻自朔方回，恩泽遥从北海来。\n涓滴须令沾涸辙，吹嘘合遣到寒灰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21976,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"故园","author":"文徵明","text":"屋舍小山村，终然思故园。\n雨晴秋倚阁，月出夜开门。\n好景亦时改，远人空目存。\n梅花未消息，行矣晚何言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21977,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有怀刘协中","author":"文徵明","text":"东风度幽馆，群鸟相和鸣。\n念子会无期，茫然过清明。\n春江芳草远，怀人心目惊。\n如何多朋友，我独傍山城。\n岂无樽酒欢，亦有花木荣。\n所怜异乡物，徒念心怔营。\n白云度水去，日暮山纵横。\n倚阑咏修竹，千里何当并。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21978,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅唐子畏梦余见寄之作","author":"文徵明","text":"故人别后千回梦，想见诗中语笑哗。\n自是多情能记忆，春来何止到君家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21979,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"行色","author":"文徵明","text":"秋山马前空复横，马蹄不作看山行。\n悠然回首何处所，此心已到他州城。\n火灯匆匆鸡一声，贵贱富贫俱有程。\n相看一语出不得，细雨欲落空江明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21980,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东葛城夜发","author":"文徵明","text":"萧萧东葛路，马上听严更。\n月出高山黑，天空远水明。\n年光秋渐索，客子夜犹行。\n村落知何处，时闻犬吠声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21981,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至定山辱庄先生赠诗次韵奉荅","author":"文徵明","text":"稚齿穷身岂有知，偶陪高论得移时。\n感公不以愚顽弃，顾我何堪远大期。\n草阁便须终岁住，仆人休讶出山迟。\n归来乞得尧夫句，暮雨秋灯不断思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21982,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"文徵明","text":"孤坐忽不乐，挑灯当我前。\n素书横几案，欲读已茫然。\n当年念有负，誓志轶前贤。\n富贵亦何物，未老已自怜。\n嗟哉昔恶闻，零落今同焉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21983,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大雪不出偶成八韵自斋中所见外皆禁不犯","author":"文徵明","text":"静坐朝慵出，不知风雪临。\n凝晖上窗纸，积冷到衣衿。\n小片投墙隙，馀威结研心。\n聆音琤可喜，想像浩难禁。\n童子传来看，家人报说深。\n卷书空自照，杯酒不辞斟。\n意赏何烦对，传闻不害吟。\n未应闭户卧，不及放舟寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21984,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简子畏","author":"文徵明","text":"落魄迂疏不事家，郎君性气属豪华。\n高楼大叫秋觞月，深幄微酣夜拥花。\n坐令端人疑阮籍，未宜文士目刘叉。\n只应郡郭声名在，门外时停长者车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21985,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅除夜杂书 其一","author":"文徵明","text":"千门万户易桃符，东舍西邻送历书。\n二十五年如水去，人生消得几番除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21986,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅除夜杂书 其二","author":"文徵明","text":"多事关心偶不眠，随人也当守残年。\n不须更说新春事，来岁今宵在目前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21987,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅除夜杂书 其三","author":"文徵明","text":"人家除夕正忙时，我自挑灯拣旧诗。\n莫笑书生太迂阔，一年功课是文词。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21988,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅除夜杂书 其四","author":"文徵明","text":"小童篝火洁门闾，为说今年忌扫除。\n却有穷愁与多病，无因岁晚一般驱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21989,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲寅除夜杂书 其五","author":"文徵明","text":"遥夜迟迟烛有花，家人欢笑说年华。\n人生勿苦求身外，常得团圆有几家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21990,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崇义院杂题 其一","author":"文徵明","text":"小院风清橘吐花，墙阴微转日斜斜。\n午眠新觉书无味，閒倚阑干嗽苦茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21991,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崇义院杂题 其二","author":"文徵明","text":"缥缈游丝堕不收，悠然庭砌绿阴稠。\n院凉僧少音声绝，时听敲门亦自幽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21992,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崇义院杂题 其四","author":"文徵明","text":"殿阁微凉吹葛衣，槛前梅子雨霏霏。\n清谈时有间僧对，手擘棕榈当麈挥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21993,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崇义院杂题 其五","author":"文徵明","text":"白日悠悠抵岁遥，困来书卷暂相抛。\n马蹄不到松阴下，手弄残棋独自敲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21994,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崇义院杂题 其六","author":"文徵明","text":"茗碗垆薰意有馀，日长人散闭精庐。\n俄然屋角凉风顺，吹起新蝉乱读书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21995,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崇义院杂题 其七","author":"文徵明","text":"绕寺松杉近百栽，孤花明透绿丛开。\n晚凉却扇池边立，袅袅馀芬度水来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21996,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崇义院杂题 其八","author":"文徵明","text":"髹几新揩滑欲流，时时弄笔小窗幽。\n自怜多好还成累，挥汗为人写扇头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21997,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崇义院杂题 其九","author":"文徵明","text":"修廊如洗断尘嚣，白粉墙围碧瓦寮。\n拥鼻徐行成独咏，晚风吹乱石芭蕉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21998,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮子畏小楼","author":"文徵明","text":"今日解驰逐，投閒傍高庐。\n君家在皋桥，諠阗井市区。\n何以掩市声，充楼古今书。\n左陈四五册，右倾三两壶。\n我饮良有限，伴子聊相娱。\n与子故深密，奔忙坐阔疏。\n旬月一会面，意勤情有馀。\n苍烟薄城首，振袖复踌躇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21999,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"余画金焦落照图吴水部德徵先生寄诗二首题谢长句","author":"文徵明","text":"忆昨浮船下扬子，平翻渺渺波千里。\n何来双岛挟飞楼，璀璨彤煌截涛起。\n夕峰倒堕满江阴，霜树高浮半空紫。\n舟人指点落日处，凌乱烟光射金绮。\n平生快睹无此奇，却恨归帆北风驶。\n至今伟迹在胸中，回首登临心不已。\n偶然兴落尺纸间，便欲平吞大江水。\n固知心手不相能，涂抹聊当卧游尔。\n晴窗舒卷日数回，不敢示人聊自喜。\n水部先生诗有名，忽寄瑶篇重称美。\n漫云家法自湖州，自愧区区何足齿。\n由来题品系名声，何况先生是诗史。\n君不见当年画马曹将军，附名甫集犹不死。\n又不见阎公自谓起文儒，池上俄蒙画师耻。\n人生固有幸不幸，拙劣何堪古人拟。\n江山千载等陈迹，一笑宁须论非是。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22000,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙卯除夕","author":"文徵明","text":"糕果登盘酒荐椒，笑歌聊用永今宵。\n老亲自喜还家健，幼女仍誇学语娇。\n终岁悲欢言莫尽，一灯团聚福难消。\n桃符日历年年好，不谓青春却暗凋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":22001,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]